Most of the interviewers asked us to provide  AWS CLI commands.

1. Configure CLI

aws configure
Set AWS access key, secret, region, and output format (json, text, table).

2. Get Caller Identity

aws sts get-caller-identity
Verify which IAM role or user is being used for the session.

3. List IAM Users

aws iam list-users

View all users in the AWS account.

 4. Upload File to S3

aws s3 cp file.txt s3://my-bucket/

Upload a file to S3. Add --recursive to upload a folder.

5. List S3 Bucket Contents

baws s3 ls s3://my-bucket/

6. Create EC2 Key Pair

aws ec2 create-key-pair --key-name MyKey --query 'KeyMaterial' --output text > MyKey.pem

Generates SSH key for EC2 login.

7. Launch EC2 Instance


aws ec2 run-instances \
--image-id ami-xxxxxxxx \
--instance-type t2.micro \
--key-name MyKey \
--security-groups my-sg \
--count 1

8. Describe EC2 Instances

baws ec2 describe-instances

9. Stop EC2 Instance

aws ec2 stop-instances --instance-ids i-0123456789abcdef0

10. Start EC2 Instance

aws ec2 start-instances --instance-ids i-0123456789abcdef0

11. Terminate EC2 Instance

aws ec2 terminate-instances --instance-ids i-0123456789abcdef0

12. List All EBS Volumes

aws ec2 describe-volumes

13. Attach IAM Role to EC2

aws ec2 associate-iam-instance-profile \
--instance-id i-0123456789abcdef0 \
--iam-instance-profile Name="MyEC2Role"

14. Monitor CloudWatch Logs

baws logs describe-log-groups

aws logs get-log-events --log-group-name /my/app --log-stream-name my-stream

15. Create IAM Role

aws iam create-role \
--role-name MyRole \
--assume-role-policy-document file://trust-policy.json

16. Create and Attach Policy

aws iam put-role-policy \
--role-name MyRole \
--policy-name MyPolicy \
--policy-document file://policy.json

17. Deploy with CloudFormation

aws cloudformation deploy \
--template-file template.yaml \
--stack-name mystack \
--capabilities CAPABILITY_IAM

18. Create Lambda Function

aws lambda create-function \
--function-name MyLambda \
--runtime python3.9 \
--handler lambda_function.lambda_handler \
--role arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/MyRole \
--zip-file fileb://function.zip

19. Publish SNS Message

aws sns publish \
--topic-arn arn:aws:sns:region:account-id:topic-name \
--message "Server down alert"

20. Send Email with SES

baws ses send-email \
--from sender@example.com \
--destination ToAddresses=recipient@example.com \
--message file://message.json
